<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43188" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scyphus</span></b> , i,
		m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκύφος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a cup</i>, <i>goblet</i> (cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">calix, poculum),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. As. 2, 4, 38</span></i>
			; Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Gell. 3, 14, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 4, 14, § 32</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Tib.
				1, 10, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 8, 278</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 1,
				27, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Epod. 9, 33 al.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 34,
				14, 40, § 141</span></i>; <i><span class="en">34, 17, 48, §
			163</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">illuseras heri inter scyphos,</span>”
				i. e. <i>while drinking</i>, <i>over our wine</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fam. 7, 22 <i>init.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">candelabri scyphi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Exod. 37, 17</span></i>
			.</div>
